 the panic, timing, and humiliation up close. VR Streamer Mode adds a stable 1080p spectator view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951590/extras/8cc9afb65760d5086d3b13c1dad4c316.poster.avif?t=1788260732\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951590/extras/8cc9afb65760d5086d3b13c1dad4c316.webm?t=1788260732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951590/extras/8cc9afb65760d5086d3b13c1dad4c316.mp4?t=1788260732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INCLUDES MULTIPLE METHODS OF REGRET</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for global high scores. Compete in Weekly Challenges. Chase clean streaks. Risk one more scratch. Panic-look upward. Pretend nothing happened. Fail instantly. Restart. Do it again because this time you definitely saw a safe window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHY WOULD YOU PLAY THIS?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Because the itch is there.<br>Because nobody is looking.<br>Because one more scratch might be the run.</h2>", "short_description": "Your balls itch. You are in public. This is now everybody’s problem. Covertly scratch your balls through multiple public incidents, battle your useless hand, and stop before everyone finds out what kind of person you are.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951590/7428aeb87e83bbfc666986fa132131bc1e54dc0b/header.jpg?t=1788260732", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951590/0